      "role": "user",
      "content": "i did something at work. i made a mistake in the calculations for the structural load on that new bridge project... and now they found a hairline fracture in the support beams. it wasnt even my direct oversight but i was the lead on the data verification. i feel like im just a walking disaster. i look in the mirror and i don't even see a person anymore, just a mistake that needs to be corrected. i feel like such a stain on everything i touch.",
